		["{npc:5391} is caged at the north end of the sanctuary. Free him and keep him alive on the walk out; his strongbox waits by the road afterwards."] = "{npc:5391}被关在避难所北端的笼子里。救出他，并在护送他出去时保护他存活；之后他的保险箱就在路边。",
